{
  "_doc": "Tier-1 pool building (random towns, commercial lots): a coin laundry with three flats over it. Route: the glass front doors are chained -> round the side to where a pickup went through the wall -> the laundry floor: big dryers stand open along the far wall and one isn't empty (searching the change machine or opening the staff door wakes them: ambush) -> back hall -> Dee's change office: the stair key -> unlock the back stair -> upstairs hall (loose boards wake Hal's flat) -> Hal's flat, its door kicked in and cans strung across it -> through the hole he clawed in the party wall into the Bauers' front room (loot; their own door is nailed shut from inside; Tom guards it) -> back down, unbolt the back door into the alley. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
